<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
<meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src https://api.github.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'">
<meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
<title>{{ site.title }}{% if ed and not latest %} · {{ ed.date | long_date }}{% endif %}</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='14' fill='%23000'/%3E%3Cpath d='M22 50V14h12a11 11 0 0 1 0 22h-6' fill='none' stroke='%23f5f5f7' stroke-width='6' stroke-linecap='round'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;600&display=swap">
<style>
/* Apple-style full-bleed tiles in one dark palette: true-black and near-black bands alternate,
   cards sit one step lighter, a single blue carries every action. */
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg: #000000;
  --band: #0e0e0f;          /* alternate tile */
  --band-2: #161617;        /* third tile tone */
  --card: #1c1c1e;
  --card-2: #232325;
  --ink: #f5f5f7;
  --body: #c7c7cc;          /* summaries: softer than headlines for long reads */
  --muted: #8e8e93;
  --hairline: #2c2c2e;
  --accent: #2997ff;
  --accent-focus: #4aa8ff;
  --like: #2997ff;
  --less: #ff9f0a;
  --chip: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
  --frost: rgba(16, 16, 18, 0.78);
  --img-bg: #2a2a2c;
  --font-display: "SF Pro Display", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Inter", "Hiragino Sans", "Noto Sans JP", sans-serif;
  --font-text: "SF Pro Text", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Inter", "Hiragino Sans", "Noto Sans JP", sans-serif;
  --font-jp: "Hiragino Sans", "Noto Sans JP", system-ui, sans-serif;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; background: var(--bg); }
body {
  margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink);
  font-family: var(--font-text); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.47; letter-spacing: -0.374px;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
}
body::before { content: ""; position: fixed; inset: 0 0 auto; height: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); z-index: 10; background: var(--bg); }
a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent-focus); outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 8px; }
img { max-width: 100%; display: block; }
.wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-left, 0px)); padding-right: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px)); }

.gnav { background: var(--bg); padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
.gnav .wrap { height: 44px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
.brand { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 17px; letter-spacing: -0.2px; color: var(--ink); }
.gnav nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; margin-left: auto; }
.gnav nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.gnav nav a { color: var(--ink); opacity: .75; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.12px; white-space: nowrap; }
.gnav nav a:hover { opacity: 1; }

.subnav { position: sticky; top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); z-index: 5; background: var(--frost); -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px); backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
.subnav .wrap { min-height: 52px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding-block: 8px; }
.subnav h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 21px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.231px; line-height: 1.19; white-space: nowrap; }
.days { display: flex; gap: 6px; overflow-x: auto; scrollbar-width: none; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.days::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.pill { font: inherit; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.224px; line-height: 1; border: 0; border-radius: 9999px; padding: 10px 14px; cursor: pointer; background: var(--chip); color: var(--ink); white-space: nowrap; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-height: 34px; transition: transform .12s ease; }
.pill:active { transform: scale(0.95); }
.pill[aria-current="page"], .pill[aria-pressed="true"], .pill.primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; }
.pill .dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--less); }
.pill .dot[hidden] { display: none; }

.hero { background: var(--bg); text-align: center; }
.hero .wrap { padding-block: 64px 48px; display: grid; gap: 12px; justify-items: center; }
.eyebrow { font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.224px; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 600; }
.hero h1 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-size: 56px; line-height: 1.07; letter-spacing: -0.28px; text-wrap: balance; }
.hero .lead { margin: 0; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.38; color: var(--body); max-width: 42ch; text-wrap: balance; }
.stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
.stat { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; background: var(--card); border-radius: 9999px; padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.stat b { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }

.tile { --t-bg: var(--bg); --c-bg: var(--card); background: var(--t-bg); scroll-margin-top: 60px; }
.tile.parchment { --t-bg: var(--band); --c-bg: var(--card); }
.tile.dark { --t-bg: var(--band-2); --c-bg: var(--card-2); }
.tile > .wrap { padding-block: 72px; display: grid; gap: 32px; }
.tile-head { display: grid; gap: 6px; text-align: center; justify-items: center; }
.tile-head h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: 600; text-wrap: balance; }
.tile-head .jp { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.2em; }
.tile-head p { margin: 0; font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.38; color: var(--body); }
.tile-head .count { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }

.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr)); gap: 20px; }
.card { background: var(--c-bg); border-radius: 18px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; transition: opacity .2s ease; }
.card .media { display: block; position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; background: var(--img-bg); overflow: hidden; }
.card .media img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform .4s ease; }
.card .media:hover img { transform: scale(1.03); }
.card .media .play { position: absolute; left: 14px; bottom: 14px; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(0,0,0,.6); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); display: grid; place-items: center; }
.body { padding: 20px 24px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.card.lead { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.card.lead .body { padding: 28px 32px 24px; justify-content: center; }
.card.lead h3 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; line-height: 1.14; letter-spacing: -0.2px; }
.card.lead .sum { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.47; max-width: 62ch; }
@media (min-width: 834px) {
  .card.lead.has-img { flex-direction: row; }
  .card.lead.has-img .media { flex: 0 0 56%; aspect-ratio: auto; min-height: 340px; }
}
.tile.stationery .card .media { aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; }
.meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 6px 10px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.12px; color: var(--muted); }
.meta .src { font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
.badge { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-radius: 9999px; padding: 3px 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0; }
.kind { border: 1px solid var(--hairline); color: var(--body); border-radius: 9999px; padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0; }
.card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.29; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.374px; text-wrap: pretty; }
.card h3 a { color: var(--ink); }
.card h3 a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
.jp-title { font-family: var(--font-jp); font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
.sum { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -0.24px; color: var(--body); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.foot { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 6px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 14px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: -0.224px; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.links .also { color: var(--muted); }
.votes { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex: none; }
.vote { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; border: 0; background: var(--chip); color: var(--body); display: grid; place-items: center; cursor: pointer; transition: transform .12s ease, background .15s ease, color .15s ease; }
.vote:active { transform: scale(0.92); }
.vote svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }
.vote.up[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--like); color: #fff; }
.vote.down[aria-pressed="true"] { background: var(--less); color: #000; }
.card.read { opacity: .5; }
.card.read:hover, .card.read:focus-within { opacity: .9; }
.hide-read .card.read { display: none; }
.allread { display: none; text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
.hide-read .grid.all-read + .allread { display: block; }

.pager { background: var(--bg); }
.pager .wrap { padding-block: 32px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.empty { background: var(--bg); text-align: center; }
.empty .wrap { padding-block: 80px; display: grid; gap: 10px; justify-items: center; }
.empty h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 34px; font-weight: 600; }
.empty p { margin: 0; color: var(--body); max-width: 46ch; }
footer { background: var(--bg); color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: -0.12px; }
footer .wrap { padding-block: 32px 56px; display: grid; gap: 8px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); }
footer p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 90ch; }
footer a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: underline; }

/* Likes panel */
dialog { border: 0; padding: 0; border-radius: 18px; background: var(--card); color: var(--ink); width: min(520px, calc(100vw - 32px)); max-height: calc(100dvh - 48px); overflow: auto; }
dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(6px); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); }
.sheet { padding: 28px; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
.sheet h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
.sheet p, .sheet li { margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--body); }
.sheet ol { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: grid; gap: 6px; }
.sheet b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
.sheet .row { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
.sheet input { flex: 1; min-width: 0; font: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-radius: 9999px; padding: 10px 16px; min-height: 44px; }
.status { font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); min-height: 1.4em; }
.status.ok { color: #30d158; }
.status.err { color: #ff6961; }

@media (max-width: 734px) {
  .hero h1 { font-size: 34px; }
  .hero .lead, .tile-head p { font-size: 17px; }
  .tile-head h2 { font-size: 28px; }
  .tile > .wrap { padding-block: 48px; gap: 24px; }
  .hero .wrap { padding-block: 40px 32px; }
  .card.lead .body { padding: 20px 24px 20px; }
  .card.lead h3 { font-size: 21px; }
  .subnav h2 { display: none; }
  .likes-label { display: none; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { transition: none !important; } }
</style>
</head>
<body data-repo="{{ feedback.repo }}" data-issue="{{ feedback.issue }}">
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute" aria-hidden="true">
  <symbol id="i-up" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7 10v11H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-9a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3Zm0 0 4-7a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2.5 2.5V9h5.2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2.3l-1.2 8A2 2 0 0 1 17.5 21H7"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-down" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 14V3h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3Zm0 0-4 7a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5-2.5V15H5.3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2.3l1.2-8A2 2 0 0 1 6.5 3H17"/></symbol>
  <symbol id="i-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="#fff" d="M8 5.5v13a1 1 0 0 0 1.5.9l10.4-6.5a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.8L9.5 4.6A1 1 0 0 0 8 5.5Z"/></symbol>
</svg>

<header class="gnav">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="./">{{ site.title }}</a>
    <nav aria-label="Topics">
      {% for t in topics %}<a href="#{{ t.key }}">{{ t.short or t.name }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="subnav">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>{% if ed and not latest %}{{ ed.date | short_day }}{% else %}Today{% endif %}</h2>
    <nav class="days" aria-label="Editions">
      {% for n in nav[:7] %}
      <a class="pill" href="{{ n.file if not loop.first else './' }}"{% if ed and n.date == ed.date %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}>{{ 'Today' if loop.first else (n.date | short_day) }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </nav>
    <button class="pill" id="likesBtn" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog"><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-up"/></svg><span class="likes-label">Likes</span><span class="dot" id="pendingDot" hidden></span></button>
    <button class="pill" id="hideRead" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Hide read</button>
  </div>
</div>

<main>
{% if not ed %}
  <section class="empty"><div class="wrap">
    <h2>No edition yet</h2>
    <p>The first edition appears here after the next morning run.</p>
  </div></section>
{% else %}
  {% set stories = ed.stories %}
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">{{ site.greeting if latest else 'Earlier edition' }}</div>
    <h1>{{ ed.date | long_date }}</h1>
    {% if ed.headline %}<p class="lead">{{ ed.headline }}</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="stats">
      {% for t in topics %}
      <a class="stat" href="#{{ t.key }}"><b>{{ stories | selectattr('topic', 'equalto', t.key) | list | length }}</b>{{ t.name }}</a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div></section>

  {% for t in topics %}
  {% set list = stories | selectattr('topic', 'equalto', t.key) | list %}
  <section class="tile {{ t.tone }} {{ t.key }}" id="{{ t.key }}"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="tile-head">
      {% if t.jp %}<div class="jp" lang="ja">{{ t.jp }}</div>{% endif %}
      <h2>{{ t.name }}</h2>
      <p>{{ t.tagline }}</p>
      <div class="count">{% if list %}{{ list | length }} {{ 'story' if list | length == 1 else 'stories' }}{% else %}Quiet morning. Nothing new here.{% endif %}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid">
      {% for s in list %}
      {% set when = age(s.date, ed.date) %}
      <article class="card{% if loop.first %} lead{% endif %}{% if s.image %} has-img{% endif %}" data-id="{{ s.id }}" data-topic="{{ s.topic }}" data-source="{{ s.source }}" data-title="{{ s.title }}">
        {% if s.image %}
        <a class="media" href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="{{ s.image }}" alt="" loading="{{ 'eager' if loop.first else 'lazy' }}" decoding="async">
          {% if s.kind == 'video' %}<span class="play"><svg width="20" height="20"><use href="#i-play"/></svg></span>{% endif %}
        </a>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="body">
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="src">{{ s.source }}</span><span>{{ when }}</span>
            {% if s.kind == 'video' %}<span class="kind">Video</span>{% elif s.kind == 'reddit' %}<span class="kind">Discussion</span>{% endif %}
            {% if when in ('Today', 'Yesterday') %}<span class="badge">New</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
          <h3><a href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ s.title }}</a></h3>
          {% if s.title_ja %}<div class="jp-title" lang="ja">{{ s.title_ja }}</div>{% endif %}
          {% if s.summary %}<p class="sum">{{ s.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
          <div class="foot">
            <div class="links">
              <a href="{{ s.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ 'Watch' if s.kind == 'video' else 'Read' }} on {{ s.source }} ›</a>
              {% for a in s.also or [] %}<a class="also" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Also on {{ a.source }}</a>{% endfor %}
            </div>
            <div class="votes">
              <button class="vote up" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="More like this" title="More like this"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-up"/></svg></button>
              <button class="vote down" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Less like this" title="Less like this"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-down"/></svg></button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="allread">You're all caught up here.</p>
  </div></section>
  {% endfor %}

  {% if older or newer %}
  <nav class="pager" aria-label="Other editions"><div class="wrap">
    {% if older %}<a class="pill" href="{{ older }}.html">‹ {{ older | long_date }}</a>{% else %}<span></span>{% endif %}
    {% if newer %}<a class="pill" href="{{ newer }}.html">{{ newer | long_date }} ›</a>{% endif %}
  </div></nav>
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}
</main>

<footer><div class="wrap">
  {% if ed %}<p>Edition compiled {{ ed.generated_at[:16] | replace('T', ' at ') }} ({{ site.timezone }}) from {{ ed.sources_ok }} of {{ ed.sources_total }} sources{% if ed.writer %}, summaries written by {{ ed.writer }}{% endif %}{% if ed.taste and (ed.taste.likes or ed.taste.dislikes) %}, tuned by {{ ed.taste.likes }} likes and {{ ed.taste.dislikes }} “less like this”{% endif %}. Summaries are paraphrased; tap a headline for the original. Pictures are thumbnails of each article's own preview image.</p>{% endif %}
  <p>Read stories and votes are remembered on this device. <a href="https://github.com/Alt-Py/PLINE">How Pline works</a></p>
</div></footer>

<dialog id="likesDialog" aria-labelledby="likesTitle">
  <form method="dialog" class="sheet" id="likesForm">
    <h2 id="likesTitle">Teach Pline your taste</h2>
    <p>Tap <b>More like this</b> or <b>Less like this</b> on any story. Each morning Pline favours what you liked and shows less of what you didn't, by source and by subject.</p>
    <p id="likesCount">No votes yet.</p>
    <p>Votes are kept on this device until they're sent to Pline. To send them, connect a GitHub token once on each device:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Open <a href="https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens/new" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub › Fine-grained tokens › Generate new token</a>.</li>
      <li>Repository access: <b>Only select repositories › PLINE</b>.</li>
      <li>Permissions: <b>Issues › Read and write</b>. Nothing else.</li>
      <li>Paste the token below. It stays in this browser only.</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="row">
      <input id="tokenInput" type="password" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="github_pat_…" aria-label="GitHub token">
      <button class="pill primary" id="saveToken" type="button">Connect</button>
    </div>
    <div class="status" id="likesStatus" role="status"></div>
    <div class="row">
      <button class="pill" id="sendNow" type="button">Send votes now</button>
      <button class="pill" id="forgetToken" type="button">Disconnect this device</button>
      <button class="pill" value="close" style="margin-left:auto">Done</button>
    </div>
  </form>
</dialog>

<script src="app.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
